om/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/ultra.webp\"\n\t\t\t\t\tsrcset=\"https://www.coldharbourblue.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/ultra-300x169.webp 300w, https://www.coldharbourblue.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/ultra-1024x576.webp 1024w, https://www.coldharbourblue.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/ultra-768x432.webp 768w, https://www.coldharbourblue.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/ultra-600x338.webp 600w, https://www.coldharbourblue.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/ultra.webp 1066w\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\talt=\"\"\n\t\t\t/>\n</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"tribe-events-calendar-month__calendar-event-tooltip-datetime\">\n\t\t<time datetime=\"2026-07-07\">\n\t\t<span class=\"tribe-event-date-start\">July 7 @ 8:00 pm</span> - <span class=\"tribe-event-time\">10:00 pm</span>\t</time>\n\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"tribe-events-calendar-month__calendar-event-tooltip-title tribe-common-h7\">\n\t<a\n\t\thref=\"https://www.coldharbourblue.com/event/ultras/\"\n\t\ttitle=\"Ultras\"\n\t\trel=\"bookmark\"\n\t\tclass=\"tribe-events-calendar-month__calendar-event-tooltip-title-link tribe-common-anchor-thin\"\n\t>\n\t\tUltras\t</a>\n</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"tribe-events-calendar-month__calendar-event-tooltip-description tribe-common-b3\">\n\t<p>Ultras – the heart and soul of football stadiums around the globe. The supporters that will do anything for the team and yields that extra power into the game to help their team win. ULTRAS is not your regular sports film. Through epic images and a cinematic mosaic of football supporters and their societal contexts [&hellip;]</p>\n</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"tribe-events-c-small-cta tribe-common-b3 tribe-events-calendar-month__calendar-event-tooltip-cost\">\n\t\t\t<span class=\"tribe-events-c-small-cta__price\">\n\t\t&pound;10.00\t</span>\n</div>\n\t</div>\n</div>\n\n\t</div>\n\n</article>\n\n\t</div>\n\n\t\n</div>\n</td>\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<td\n\t class=\"tribe-events-calendar-month__day tribe-events-calendar-month__day--past\" \taria-labelledby=\"tribe-events-calendar