 pm\t</time>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"tribe-events-calendar-month__calendar-event-datetime-separator\"> - </span>\n\t\t<time datetime=\"22:00\">\n\t\t\t10:00 pm\t\t</time>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"tribe-events-calendar-month__calendar-event-title tribe-common-h8 tribe-common-h--alt\">\n\t<a\n\t\thref=\"https://www.coldharbourblue.com/event/weird-wednesday-jacobs-ladder-1990/\"\n\t\ttitle=\"Weird Wednesday &#8211; Jacob&#8217;s Ladder (1990)\"\n\t\trel=\"bookmark\"\n\t\tclass=\"tribe-events-calendar-month__calendar-event-title-link tribe-common-anchor-thin\"\n\t\tdata-js=\"tribe-events-tooltip\"\n\t\tdata-tooltip-content=\"#tribe-events-tooltip-content-15524\"\n\t\taria-describedby=\"tribe-events-tooltip-content-15524\"\n\t>\n\t\tWeird Wednesday &#8211; Jacob&#8217;s Ladder (1990)\t</a>\n</div>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"tribe-events-calendar-month__calendar-event-tooltip-template tribe-common-a11y-hidden\">\n\t<div\n\t\tclass=\"tribe-events-calendar-month__calendar-event-tooltip\"\n\t\tid=\"tribe-events-tooltip-content-15524\"\n\t\trole=\"tooltip\"\n\t>\n\t\t<div class=\"tribe-events-calendar-month__calendar-event-tooltip-featured-image-wrapper\">\n\t<img\n\t\tclass=\"tribe-events-calendar-month__calendar-event-tooltip-featured-image\"\n\t\tsrc=\"https://www.coldharbourblue.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/jacob.webp\"\n\t\t\t\t\tsrcset=\"https://www.coldharbourblue.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/jacob-300x169.webp 300w, https://www.coldharbourblue.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/jacob-1024x576.webp 1024w, https://www.coldharbourblue.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/jacob-768x432.webp 768w, https://www.coldharbourblue.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/jacob-600x338.webp 600w, https://www.coldharbourblue.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/jacob.webp 1066w\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\talt=\"\"\n\t\t\t/>\n</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"tribe-events-calendar-month__calendar-event-tooltip-datetime\">\n\t\t<time datetime=\"2026-07-08\">\n\t\t<span class=\"tribe-event-date-start\">July 8 @ 8:00 pm</span> - <span class=\"tribe-event-time\">10:00 pm</span>\t</time>\n\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"tribe-events-calendar-month__calendar-event-tooltip-title tribe-common-h7\">\n\t<a\n\t\thref=\"https://www.coldharbourblue.com/event/weird-wednesday-jacobs-ladder-1990/\"\n\t\ttitle=\"Weird Wednesday &#8211; Jacob&#8217;s Ladder (1990)\"\n\t\trel=\"bookmark\"\n\t\tclass=\"tribe-events-calendar-month__calendar-event-tooltip-title-link tribe-common-anchor-thin\"\n\t>\n\t\tWeird Wednesday &#8211; Jacob&#8217;s Ladder (1990)\t</a>\n</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"tribe-events-calendar-month__calendar-event-tooltip-description tribe-common-b3\">\n\t<p>After returning home from the Vietnam War, veteran Jacob Singer struggles to maintain his sanity. Plagued by hallucinations and flashbacks, Singer rapidly falls apart as the world and people around him morph and twist into disturbing images. His girlfriend, Jezzie, and ex-wife, Sarah, try to help, but to little avail. Even Singer's chiropractor friend, Louis, [&hellip;]</p>\n</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"tribe-events-c-small-cta tribe-common-b3 tribe-events-calendar-month__calendar-event-tooltip-cost\">\n\t\t\t<a\n\t\t\thref=\"https://www.coldharbourblue.com/event/weird-wednesday-jacobs-ladder-1990/#tribe-tickets__tickets-form\"\n\t\t\tclass=\"tribe-events-c-small-cta__link tribe-common-cta tribe-common-cta--thin-alt\"\n\t\t>\n\t\t\tGet Tickets\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"tribe-events-c-small-cta__price\">\n\t\t&pound;5.00\t</span>\n</div>\n\t</div>\n</div>\n\n\t</div>\n\n</article>\n\n\t</div>\n\n\t\n</div>\n</td>\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<td\n\t class=\"tribe-events-calendar-month__day tribe-events-calendar-month__day--past\" \taria-labelledby=\"tribe-events-calendar-day-2026-07-09\"\n\tdata-js=\"tribe-events-month-grid-cell\"\n>\n\t<button\n\taria-expanded=\"false\"\n\taria-controls=\"tribe-events-calendar-mobile-day-2026-07-9\"\n\taria-label=\"July 9, 0 events, past day\"\n\t class=\"tribe-events-calendar-month__day-cell tribe-events-calendar-month__day